  "Name": "Spring Break in Zombie USA",
  "Overview": "Spring Break in Zombie USA is a dark comedy action/adventure game that allows players to visit bars, clubs and more on their cross country trip across a fictional zombie infested United States. The players can steal vehicles, run over zombies, save bystanders, interact with the locals, and make stops along the way. Stores allows players to get upgraded weapons, power ups, and more. Two players may play the story locally, or an arena based version with matchmaking online.",
